1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,489
Here is the single commonest error in this unit.

2
00:00:03,489 --> 00:00:08,645
N one V one equals N two V two works only with normalities.

3
00:00:08,645 --> 00:00:13,971
If you put molarities into it, you will be wrong whenever the n factors differ.

4
00:00:13,971 --> 00:00:21,848
With molarities, always carry the n factors: n one M one V one equals n two M two V two.

